- [NEW] WebAuthn ceremony paths resolved from LIVE login HTML (not bundle-derived): `start-endpoint=/en/login/passkey/start`, `complete-endpoint=/en/login/passkey/complete`, csrf field `csrf_public_login_access` on `webauthn-authentication`; registration twin uses `csrf_user_passkey_register` + `attestation_response`.
- [NEW] CSP leaks new hostnames: `hcaptcha-broadcast.threema.ch` (script-src), `hcaptcha-assets.threema.ch` (frame/connect-src), `bugs.threema.ch` (Sentry connect), plus `form-action 'self' https://billing.threema.ch` (broadcast login may POST to billing).
- [NEW] Bundle confirms challenge POST is session+csrf-bound: assertion start posts `csrf_public_login_access` and expects `{challenge}` JSON; prior cycle's orphaned-csrf→401 observation is consistent with the source.

